Text: 2.1 Named entity recognition experiments We perform NER experiments on two datasets: the publicly available CoNLL-2002 and -2003 sets, containing Dutch, Spanish, English, and Ger- man (Tjong Kim Sang, 2002; Sang and Meulder, 2003); and an in-house dataset with 16 languages,2 using the same CoNLL categories. Table 1 shows M-BERT zero-shot performance on all language pairs in the CoNLL data.

