Section: 1 Introduction
Text: We fur- ther show that transfer works best for typolog- ically similar languages, suggesting that while M-BERT’s multilingual representation is able to map learned structures onto new vocabularies, it does not seem to learn systematic transformations of those structures to accommodate a target lan- guage with different word order.

Rank: 9
